20yYWxOOW5XUHRzUGtmMHlYaUhvWlBhZ0l2QVVqcTlrYlpwdVJUX3phMGlGRjBDcEZXQmF3YnV0aGUxclMzS3ZWdTJIYVlDX1gyeWR4YVJ2aUl5Ym5JWldrWUZlbk81OUR1ZTlycTlrS3pwdzRjUHhYVF9n?oc=5","date":"2026-10-16","zh":"44 股和 70 股 Ferguson Enterprises (FERG) 股票已交付或扣留以支付行使成本或稅款。"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":4},{"name":"併購","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-09-26","period":"2025-07-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011641/000201164125000027/ferg-20250731.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Ferguson is the largest value-added distributor serving the water and air specialized professional in our $340 billion residential and non-residential North American construction market. We help make our customers' complex projects simple, successful and sustainable by providing expertise and a wide range of products and services from plumbing, heating, ventilation and air conditioning (\"HVAC\"), appliances, and lighting to pipes, valves and fittings (\"PVF\"), water and wastewater solutions and more. We sell through a common network of distribution centers, branches, counter service and expert sales associates, showroom consultants and e-commerce channels.","zh":"Ferguson 是最大的增值分銷商，為價值 3,400 億美元的北美住宅和非住宅建築市場中的水和空氣專業人士提供服務。我們透過提供專業知識和廣泛的產品和服務，從管道、暖氣、通風和空調（“HVAC”）、電器和照明到管道、閥門和配件（“PVF”）、水和廢水解決方案等，幫助客戶的複雜項目變得簡單、成功和可持續。我們透過由配送中心、分公司、櫃檯服務和專家銷售人員、陳列室顧問和電子商務管道組成的共同網路進行銷售。"},{"en":"The Company has a long history and maintained businesses throughout Europe, Canada and the United States in the 1900s. In the early 2000s, the Company's focus shifted to attractive North American markets. As a result, the operating businesses across Europe were disposed of through various transactions. As part of this transition and following a corporate restructuring, Ferguson Enterprises Inc. became the ultimate parent company for the business in August 2024.","zh":"該公司歷史悠久，早在 1900 年代就已在歐洲、加拿大和美國開展業務。 2000 年代初，公司的重點轉向有吸引力的北美市場。結果，歐洲各地的經營業務透過各種交易被處置。作為過渡的一部分，並在公司重組後，Ferguson Enterprises Inc. 於 2024 年 8 月成為該業務的最終母公司。"},{"en":"The Company's corporate headquarters and management office are located at 751 Lakefront Commons, Newport News, Virginia 23606 and its telephone number is +1 757-874-7795.","zh":"公司總部和管理辦公室位於 751 Lakefront Commons, Newport News, Virginia 23606，電話號碼為 +1 757-874-7795。"}],"markets":[{"en":"The Company's reportable segments are established based on how the Company manages its business and allocates resources, which is on a geographical basis. The Company's reportable segments are the United States and Canada. For further segment information, see Part II, Item 7: Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations and Note 2, Segment and net sales information of the Notes to the Consolidated Financial Statements in Part II, Item 8: Financial Statements and Supplementary Data of this Annual Report (the \"Consolidated Financial Statements\"). Below is a description of the Company's reportable segments.","zh":"本公司的報告分部是根據本公司如何管理其業務和分配資源而建立的，並以地域為基礎。該公司的報告分部為美國和加拿大。詳細分部資料請參閱第二部分第7項：管理階層對財務狀況及經營成果的討論與分析及本年度報告第二部分第8項：財務報表及補充資料（以下簡稱「合併財務報表）合併財務報表附註中的附註2、分部及淨銷售額資訊。以下是公司報告分部的描述。"},{"en":"The United States segment operates primarily under the Ferguson brand, providing expertise and a wide range of products and services from plumbing, HVAC, appliances, and lighting to PVF, water and wastewater solutions, and more to residential and non-residential customers. Our products are delivered through a common network of distribution centers, branches, counter service and expert sales associates, showroom consultants and e-commerce channels. As of July 31, 2025, the United States business operated 1,519 branches, 10 regional distribution centers, as well as five market distribution centers (\"MDCs\") for branch replenishment and final mile distribution to customers. Our network serves our customers in all 50 states with approximately 32,000 associates, providing same-day and next-day product availability, which we believe to be a competitive advantage and an important requirement for","zh":"美國部門主要以 Ferguson 品牌運營，為住宅和非住宅客戶提供專業知識和廣泛的產品和服務，從管道、暖通空調、電器和照明到 PVF、水和廢水解決方案等。我們的產品透過配送中心、分公司、櫃檯服務和專家銷售人員、陳列室顧問和電子商務管道組成的共同網路進行交付。截至 2025 年 7 月 31 日，美國業務運營 1,519 個分公司、10 個區域配送中心以及 5 個市場配送中心（「MDC」），用於分公司補貨和向客戶進行最後一哩配送。我們的網路為全美 50 個州的客戶提供約 32,000 名員工服務，提供當日和隔日產品供應，我們認為這是一種競爭優勢，也是對"}],"customers":[{"en":"We help make our customers' complex projects simple, successful and sustainable. We offer expertise and a broad range of products delivered where and when our customers need them. Customers rely on us to help them deliver critical infrastructure spanning almost every stage of a project's life cycle within the residential and non-residential markets. We partner with our customers to keep millions of homes and businesses operating while helping them to run their business more efficiently. No single customer accounted for more than 1% of our net sales in fiscal 2025.","zh":"我們幫助客戶的複雜專案變得簡單、成功且可持續。我們隨時隨地為客戶提供專業知識和廣泛的產品。客戶依靠我們幫助他們提供涵蓋住宅和非住宅市場專案生命週期幾乎每個階段的關鍵基礎設施。我們與客戶合作，維持數以百萬計的家庭和企業的運營，同時幫助他們更有效地經營業務。 2025 財年，沒有任何一個客戶的銷售額占我們淨銷售額的 1% 以上。"},{"en":"Our value-added solutions include a variety of sales channels available to our customers ranging from inside and outside sales teams, sales centers, digital commerce capabilities, system-to-system capabilities, counter sales and showrooms. We also offer customized solutions such as virtual design, fabrication, valve actuation, pre-assembly, kitting, installation and project management services. With our value-added solutions, we aim to increase productivity for our customers and for the industry.","zh":"我們的增值解決方案包括為客戶提供的各種銷售管道，包括內部和外部銷售團隊、銷售中心、數位商務功能、系統到系統功能、櫃檯銷售和陳列室。我們還提供客製化解決方案，例如虛擬設計、製造、閥門驅動、預先組裝、配套、安裝和專案管理服務。透過我們的增值解決方案，我們的目標是提高客戶和產業的生產力。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We believe we are well-equipped to win new market share and generate attractive returns. We have leading positions in the residential and non-residential markets based on net sales as a percentage of overall market size. For fiscal 2025, residential and non-residential markets each account for approximately half of our net sales, with net sales within these combined markets balanced between RMI (approximately two-thirds of our net sales) and new construction (approximately one-third of our net sales), based on management's estimates. We have chosen to operate in each of these markets because we believe we can generate strong growth, solid gross and operating margins and good returns on capital.","zh":"我們相信，我們有能力贏得新的市場份額並產生有吸引力的回報。根據淨銷售額佔整體市場規模的百分比，我們在住宅和非住宅市場處於領先地位。到 2025 財年，住宅和非住宅市場分別約占我們淨銷售額的一半，根據管理層的估計，這些合併市場的淨銷售額在 RMI（約占我們淨銷售額的三分之二）和新建建築（約占我們淨銷售額的三分之一）之間保持平衡。我們選擇在這些市場開展業務是因為我們相信我們能夠實現強勁的成長、穩定的毛利率和營業利潤率以及良好的資本回報率。"},{"en":"The markets we serve are highly fragmented with very few large competitors and a high number of small, local distributors, as well as mid-size regional distributors. While our market positions can be expanded through growth of our existing business, acquisitions also remain a core part of our growth strategy and we expect to focus on acquisitions that bolt-on to our existing branch network as well as acquisitions that provide further capabilities to serve our customers. We believe there is a significant opportunity for strong growth and continued consolidation within our markets.","zh":"我們服務的市場高度分散，大型競爭對手很少，而小型本地分銷商以及中型區域分銷商數量眾多。雖然我們的市場地位可以透過現有業務的成長來擴大，但收購仍然是我們成長策略的核心部分，我們預計將重點放在與現有分支機構網路相結合的收購，以及提供進一步服務客戶能力的收購。我們相信，我們的市場存在強勁成長和持續整合的重大機會。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-07-31","items":[{"name":"United States","val":29269000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Canada","val":1493000000,"zh":"加拿大部門"}],"total":30762000000}},"peers":["CNM","CRH","TT","HUBB","WSO"]}}